SUMMARY:Oakville Historical Society - Culture Days
DESCRIPTION:Come visit the Thomas House (in Lakeside Park) and experience 1830s pioneer living! Taste Welsh cakes from the griddle\, try historical kids games\, explore daily chores and try out some of the gadgets of the time.
