SUMMARY:Weston Historical Society - October Meeting "Saving Our Library - Part II"
DESCRIPTION:Please join us at the Weston Library on Wednesday\, October 7 at 7:30p.m. as we celebrate our 50th anniversary and pick up the second half of our story – \nHow the Weston Library was saved and how the Weston Historical Society came to be! We look forward to sharing this part of Weston’s history with you and hope to see you there!
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/weston-historical-society-october-meeting-saving-our-library-part-ii/
LOCATION:Weston Branch\, Toronto Public Lbrary\, 2 King St\, York\, ON\, M9N 1K9\, Canada
END:VEVENT
