SUMMARY:Niagara Military Museum - 104th Annual Battle of Queenston Heights  Commemorative Dinner
DESCRIPTION:You are cordially invited to 104th Annual Battle of Queenston Heights Commemorative Dinner to honour the courage and sacrifice of those who fought on October 13\, 1812 \nCocktails and Prelude at Six o’Clock in the Evening\nDinner at Seven o’Clock in the Evening \nThe restaurant accommodates a maximum of 125 guests. Seating is assigned sequentially in order of reservation receipt — those who reserve earliest shall enjoy the most favoured placement. A waiting list is maintained in the event of cancellations. \n$150.00 per person. Reservations due by Wednesday\, the Seventh of October. Reserve online or by post. Enclose a cheque for $150.00 per person\, payable to the Niagara Military Museum\, with the name of each guest and any dietary or accessibility requirements\, and forward to: \nQueenston Dinner Committee\n5049 Victoria Ave\nNiagara Falls\, ON  L2E 4E2 \nDress \nMess Kit · Regalia · Dress Uniform · Period Dress\nTuxedo & Evening Dress · Dark Business Attire \nGuests are requested to familiarise themselves and their party with the dress code prior to submitting a reservation. \nInquiries: info@thequeenstondinner.ca
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/niagara-military-museum-104th-annual-battle-of-queenston-heights-commemorative-dinner/
LOCATION:Queenston Heights Restaurant\, 14184 Niagara Parkway\, Queenston\, Ontario\, L0S 1L0\, Canada
END:VEVENT
