SUMMARY:Heritage Days History Symposium Annual Conference
DESCRIPTION:Our upcoming in person conference will be on October 17\, 2026 as we support the London Heritage Council and the City of London in celebrating the Bicentennial of the City of London. \nIt will be a hybrid event with in person\, online and recording options. \nThe conference will be held at the Middlesex County Court House National Historic Site located downtown London\, Ontario. \nFor conference details\, speaker and talk information and to register for online options\, please go to: Online Conference \nFor in person registration including options to book local tours please go to: In Person Conference & Tours
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/heritage-days-history-symposium-annual-conference/
LOCATION:Middlesex County Court House National Historic Site\, 399 Ridout St N\, London\, Ontario\, N6A 2P1\, Canada
ORGANIZER;CN="The History Symposium":MAILTO:inquiries@historysymposium.com
END:VEVENT
