SUMMARY:Albion Bolton Historical Society Meeting "The Humber River: A River’s Indigenous Roots and Bolton’s Water-powered Industrial Past"
DESCRIPTION:The Albion Bolton Historical Society’s next meeting is on Monday\, October 19\, 2026 for a start time of 7:30 pm. PLEASE NOTE we are now meeting at Rotary Place\, Caledon Senior’s Centre\, 7 Rotarian Way\, Bolton\, Multi-purpose Room 2\, located behind the Caledon Wellness Centre on the North Hill. \nValerie Mackie and John McFall will present The Humber River: A River’s Indigenous Roots and Bolton’s Water-powered Industrial Past.
